{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>北京部分地區下大雪，預計明晚有一股強冷空氣影響全市。</p><p></p><p>在八達嶺長城凌晨起迎來入冬後第二場大雪，城牆白茫茫一片，北京市區未有出現雨雪，海淀區下午多雲，不時刮起大風，氣溫大約6度，有出外民眾穿羽絨和戴帽保暖。</p><p></p><p>氣象部門預計，今明兩日夜間氣溫持續下降，明晚最低溫會降至零下3度左右，而最高氣溫不會超過10度。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T09:55:59.719549+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T09:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T10:09:39.126705+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:49:25.607576+00:00","content_hash":"8083c6190faad66594fc2db3c0d30e8ef86116eb24f506cb45545ec8b130e3ba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T09:55:59.719549+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}